From 9eeede7095e2c9d8a3b87b7c97c8949249be5065 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 11:17:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Fix icon: two-line MultiDDNS wordmark instead of cropped
 logo

The previous icon was cropped from the full logo lockup and cut off
part of the "MultiDDNS" wordmark. Replaced with a purpose-built square
icon: "Multi" / "DDNS" stacked, same Anton font, navy fill and green
outline as the full logo, on the same blue gradient with rounded
corners. No cropping of any artwork.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
